    {
      "id": "claim_5d434717657f4785889fe92a8e212863",
      "statement": "Both aws_iam_role.sre_shared and aws_iam_role.lambda_invoker build an identical per-environment OIDC trust-condition pattern: an always-present StringEquals audience match against that environment's own client ID, plus an optional aws:RequestTag/uuid condition gated by enable_uuid_allowlist and an optional aws:RequestTag/roles condition restricted to required_oidc_role gated by enable_oidc_group_enforcement (default true, default role ai-sd-sre); module preconditions reject a blank allowed_uuids list or required_oidc_role while the corresponding switch is enabled.",
